{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53155","headline":"湘妃庙 · 周渭","name":"湘妃庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"代变时迁事迹存，见来谁不暗消魂。\n上程此日湘江过，依旧修篁有旧痕。\n（见《永乐大典》卷五七六九，中华书局影印本第六十册。\n）（按：《永乐大典》署「御史周谓」作。\n《周君墓志铭》云：「拜监察御史，董选补於南方。\n南方吏理清而风俗阜，抑君是赖，复命其劳，转殿中侍御史。\n」诗或即渭此次南行时作。\n「谓」爲「渭」之误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周渭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53155.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53155","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}